{"id":"poslanie","lemma":"послание","pos":"noun","rank":1632,"glosses":["message, missive","epistle"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/62/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"послания","plural":"послания"},"examples":[{"text":"Том конечно получил послание.","en":"Tom certainly got the message.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"of course, certainly"},{"g":"to receive, to get","l":"получить"},null]},{"text":"Тяжело писать любовное послание по-английски.","en":"It's not easy writing a love letter in English.","words":[{"g":"heavily, heftily"},{"g":"to write"},null,null,{"g":"along / by"},{"g":"only used in…"}]},{"text":"Том передал Мэри послание.","en":"Tom handed Mary the message.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to hand over","l":"передать"},null,null]},{"text":"У меня есть для вас послание от Тома.","en":"I have a message from Tom for you.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"},null,{"g":"from"},{"g":"volume","l":"том"}]},{"text":"Том нашёл послание в бутылке, которую вымыло на берег.","en":"Tom found a bottle with a note inside it washed up on the beach.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to find","l":"найти"},null,{"g":"in"},null,null,null,{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"bank"}]}]}